| `crates/gossip-connectors/src/filesystem.rs` | Modify `enumerate_page_bounds` if deferring stat | Lazy stat per page |
| `crates/gossip-connectors/src/filesystem.rs` | Add FD-limit constant and `WalkFrame` / `DirList` types | Walk infrastructure |
| `crates/gossip-connectors/src/filesystem_tests.rs` | Update version_id tests if deferring stat; add breadth-stress test | Validate bounded memory |

### Patterns to Follow

- walkdir's `DirList::Opened` / `DirList::Closed` pattern for FD management (`github.com/BurntSushi/walkdir/blob/master/src/lib.rs`)
- Uring walker's deferred-stat pattern (`local_fs_uring.rs:2340-2343`)
- Existing deadline check pattern (per-directory + every 512 entries, already implemented)

