| `crates/gossip-connectors/src/git.rs` | Fix version model description (lines 19-26) | Correct factual error about git capabilities |
| `crates/gossip-connectors/src/git.rs` | Clarify "invisible" claim (lines 11-17) | Distinguish enumeration snapshot from read-time behavior |

### Patterns to Follow

- `FilesystemConnector` TOCTOU section at filesystem.rs:108-118 is the
