Epic 2 needs filesystem paging to resume correctly from durable ordered progress before later runtime page-fill, done-ledger, and committed-prefix work can rely on it. Task `gossip-9273.2` establishes the filesystem ordered-content surface; this task is the follow-up that makes that surface resumable without fake cursor plumbing or token-dependent correctness.

