## Context

Epic 3 Ticket 7 is the runtime-side mirror lifecycle seam for Git MVP. Ticket 5 (`gossip-9429`) registers repo-native Git shards, and Ticket 6 (`gossip-9430`) defines how explicit commits lower into mirror-local synthetic refs, but there is still no implementation of `GitMirrorManager` that can turn a normalized local repo locator into a reusable worker-local mirror path with deterministic naming, safe first-create behavior, and retryable update semantics.

This task should implement local/static mirror management only. It owns mirror path derivation, initial mirror creation, refresh/update behavior, and concurrency/lock policy for mirror reuse. It does **not** own request normalization, explicit-commit lowering, distributed worker orchestration, or the full `scanner-git` adapter path.

