| Anti-Pattern | Why | What to Do Instead |
|-------------|-----|-------------------|
| Generic dispatch abstraction (trait object or generics) | Task explicitly warns against broadening to generic abstraction | Two concrete match arms in worker loop |
| Fabricating `PageLoopTermination` for Git | Git has no page loop; creates semantic confusion | Write dedicated 2-branch `git_shard_completion` |
| Duplicating `build_lease_from_acquire` for Git | Only the payload hydration step is filesystem-specific | Write separate `build_git_lease_from_acquire` sharing only coordination-field extraction |
