| Skipping `ensure_post_drain_lease_trust` | Lease uncertainty semantics are family-neutral | Call after Git execution, same as filesystem path |
| Starting watchdog after mirror sync | Mirror sync can outlive the lease; stale worker runs concurrently | Arm `ArmedLeaseDeadline` and spawn watchdog BEFORE `sync_mirror` |
| Adding lease renewal during execution | Filesystem uses watchdog-only model; renewal adds complexity | Follow watchdog + fail-fast pattern |

