- Ticket 11's Git runtime loop will need stable stage boundaries that this task can instrument cleanly.
- Ticket 12's distributed Git worker reporting should stop assuming filesystem-specific fields.
- Ticket 13 should add or update tests for any new Git telemetry records introduced here.

