## Desired State

A single RocksDB value per `(repo_id, policy_hash)` scope replaces all per-OID keys. The value contains a sorted OID array (for OID-to-position mapping) and a serialized Roaring bitmap (for membership). On scan startup the bitmap is deserialized once into memory; all `batch_check_seen` calls become in-memory binary search + bitmap test with zero RocksDB reads. On finalize the bitmap is serialized and written as a single `WriteBatch.put()`.

The `SeenBlobStore` trait signature is unchanged. Existing implementations (`NeverSeenStore`, `AlwaysSeenStore`, `InMemorySeenStore`) are unaffected.

