### Test Helper: `wrap_envelope`

Tests that craft blobs via `postcard::to_allocvec` (bypassing `checkpoint_serialize`) must wrap payloads in a valid CRC envelope. Add a shared test helper to reduce duplication:

```rust
/// Wrap a raw postcard payload in a valid CRC32 integrity envelope.
fn wrap_envelope(payload: &[u8]) -> Vec<u8> {
    let crc = crc32fast::hash(payload);
    let mut envelope = Vec::with_capacity(ENVELOPE_HEADER_LEN + payload.len());
    envelope.extend_from_slice(&CHECKPOINT_MAGIC);
    envelope.extend_from_slice(&crc.to_le_bytes());
    envelope.extend_from_slice(payload);
    envelope
}
```

