### Adversarial Same-Set Test

Use `hash_offset` (line 706) to pre-compute offsets that collide:

```rust
fn find_colliding_offsets(target_set: usize, sets: usize, count: usize) -> Vec<u64> {
    let mask = sets - 1;
    (0u64..)
        .filter(|&off| (hash_offset(off) as usize & mask) == target_set)
        .take(count)
        .collect()
}
```

Then run insert/get sequences exclusively on those offsets to stress the
4-way CLOCK eviction within a single set.

